      "score": 2,
      "comments": 0,
      "author": "sy",
      "published": "2026-08-11T10:11:38Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Automating deployments across multi-cluster service meshes requires federated architectures using Istio or Linkerd for cross-boundary traffic routing.",
        "Secure inter-mesh CI/CD pipelines rely on SPIFFE/SPIRE identity federation to enforce cross-domain mTLS and zero-trust policy controls.",
        "Progressive delivery controllers like Argo Rollouts orchestrate inter-mesh traffic splitting and canary deployments via ingress gateway policies."
      ]
    },
